Third-party components
======================

The shipped programs (ContextCompanion.Core, ContextCompanion.App,
ContextCompanion.Platform.Windows and the `ccomp` tool) use the .NET 10
runtime and the Windows Desktop runtime (WPF, and Windows Forms for the tray
icon), both MIT licensed by the .NET Foundation and Microsoft, and the
packages below.

DPAPI (ContextCompanion.Platform.Windows, and the Windows build of `ccomp`):
  System.Security.Cryptography.ProtectedData 10.0.0
  Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
  Licence: MIT
  https://github.com/dotnet/runtime

Windows Runtime projections (ContextCompanion.Platform.Windows, the app and
the Windows build of `ccomp`, through the net10.0-windows10.0.19041.0 target):
  Microsoft.Windows.SDK.NET.Ref 10.0.19041.57, selected by the .NET SDK for
  that target framework, used for Windows.Graphics.Capture. It contains:
  - Microsoft.Windows.SDK.NET.dll, the Windows SDK projection
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
    Licence: Microsoft Windows SDK licence terms, https://aka.ms/WinSDKLicenseURL
  - WinRT.Runtime.dll, the C#/WinRT runtime
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
    Licence: MIT
    https://github.com/microsoft/CsWinRT

